OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CLong waits 'a tragedy' as thousands    
OL,5,Cseek ADHD and autism assessments       
OL,6,GA GP has warned that long waits for    
OL,7,GADHD and autism assessments are        
OL,8,Gcreating a situation where the people  
OL,9,Gmost in need are not being seen.       
OL,11,FAccording to experts, demand has risen 
OL,12,Fso sharply in recent years that it now 
OL,13,Ffar exceeds what the mental health     
OL,14,Fsystem can cope with.                  
OL,16,FNew figures seen by BBC Scotland News  
OL,17,Fsuggest more than 38,000 adults are    
OL,18,Fwaiting for neurodevelopmental         
OL,19,Fassessments, with at least 14,000 of   
OL,20,Fthem waiting longer than two years.    
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
