OL,4,CNHS Grampian surgeon was ready to      
OL,5,Coperate on patient while recovering    
OL,6,Cfrom medical procedure                 
OL,7,GAn NHS Grampian surgeon attempted to   
OL,8,Gtake over a knee operation while he    
OL,9,Gwas recovering from a medical          
OL,10,Gprocedure and under the influence of   
OL,11,Gdrugs, the BBC has learned.            
OL,13,FThe doctor, who had to be driven to Dr 
OL,14,FGray's hospital in Elgin, allegedly    
OL,15,Ftried to step in because a colleague   
OL,16,Ffelt unable to complete the surgery.   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
