OL,4,CMum's tribute to 'beautiful boy' who   
OL,5,Cdied in alleged attack                 
OL,6,GThe mother of a man who died in        
OL,7,Ghospital in Dundee after being         
OL,8,Gseriously injured in Arbroath has paid 
OL,9,Gtribute to her "beautiful boy".        
OL,11,FReece Massie, from Dundee, was         
OL,12,Fdiscovered in the grounds of Ninewells 
OL,13,FHospital shortly after 03:45 on        
OL,14,FSunday, but died shortly afterwards.   
OL,16,FJayden Gray, 25, appeared in private   
OL,17,Fat Forfar Sheriff Court on Tuesday     
OL,18,Faccused of murdering the 21-year-old.  
OL,20,FReece's mother Leanne Boath said that  
OL,21,Fher son was "my whole life" and she    
OL,22,Fhad been "left heartbroken."      G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
